      "message": "Lin: I believe the null check for `rd_stats_y` makes Coverity think the `rd_stats_y` parameter to this function may be a null pointer. Before this point, we already pass `rd_stats_y` to `inter_modes_info_push()` at line 1838 and line 1844, and `inter_modes_info_push()` dereferences its `rd_cost_y` parameter without checking. So that\u0027s a strong evidence that `rd_stats_y` cannot be null.\n\nI checked all the callers of this function and verify that they never pass a null `rd_stats_y` to this function. Once you double check this, we should remove the null pointer check for `rd_stats_y`.",
